# Local server secrets for Cloudflare Workers dev.
#
# Copy to `.dev.vars` and fill in values. `.dev.vars` (and every other
# `.dev.vars.*`) is gitignored; only this template is tracked. Real secrets do
# NOT belong here; use empty placeholders.
#
# In production, set each with `wrangler secret put <NAME>`, not from a file.
# Server secrets are declared in astro.config.mjs `env.schema`
# (context: "server", access: "secret"). See SECURITY.md for the full map.

# The Cineplex API key, sent as the Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key header on every
# upstream call. Cineplex runs no developer programme and issues no keys for one,
# so no value ships here and this file will not tell you how to obtain one. Supply
# your own only if you are authorised to use it; see the README's Status section.
# Whatever you supply can stop working at any time.
#
# Left unset, every route answers 503 upstream_unconfigured rather than pretending
# there are no showtimes. The e2e suite runs that way on purpose.
CINEPLEX_API_KEY=
